  m_Text: 'Do you want to delete <color=orange>#</color> old bundles?


    These
    bundles cannot be played on the latest version of ULTRAKILL.


    They can be
    played on an older version by downpatching ULTRAKILL to the Violence update and
    downgrading Angry to version 2.10.1


    The deletion cannot be reverted!'
